  "summary": "Radó's 1962 game over n-state, 2-symbol Turing machines: find the halting machine that runs longest (S) or writes the most 1s (Σ) from a blank tape. The functions are uncomputable and grow faster than any computable function; BB(5) = 47,176,870 was settled with a Coq-verified proof in 2024.",
